  "referee_only": {
    "actual_outcome": "Airbus launched the A320neo on 1 Dec 2010 (entry into service Jan 2016). Boeing leaned towards an all-new airplane through early 2011; after American Airlines split a record order with Airbus in July 2011, Boeing launched the 737 MAX re-engine in Aug 2011 (entry into service May 2017) and did not launch a clean sheet.",
